  "description": "A CreateClient() convenience so a .NET MAUI app can construct an Agora Signaling client the same way as every other Net.Agora product. Signaling needs no platform glue — unlike the RTC and Chat clients it takes no Android Context — so this is symmetry, not necessity: Net.Agora.Signaling works in MAUI on its own, and new AgoraSignalingClient(options) does the same thing.",
